      "message": "Two thoughts about this so far:\n\n1. This feels better suited as a CIPD package? A [number of other LLVM-related things](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:DEPS;l\u003d882) are currently pulled down from GCS instead of CIPD, though, so maybe there\u0027s a particular reason for preferring GCS for LLVM.\n\n2. This seems like something that\u0027s not necessarily Dawn-specific, and so may be better suited to live in the [3pp](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/infra/infra_superproject/+/main:infra/3pp/) infra. You\u0027d get CIPD support for free with that, as well.",
